00:56:16.330 --> 00:56:38.490
<v Ira Glass>Our website, where we have a holiday merch sale going on-- posters, DVDs, CDs, all on sale, also we just added a USB drive full of interviews that I did onstage with people like Rachel Maddow, Michael Lewis, Joss Whedon, Philip Glass many, many, more-- plus, of course, all of our old shows for free on the website www.thisamericanlife.org.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，我们那里正在进行节日商品销售——海报、DVD、CD，都在打折，我们还刚刚添加了一个USB驱动器，里面装满了我在舞台上采访雷切尔·马多（Rachel Maddow）、迈克尔·刘易斯（Michael Lewis）、乔斯·韦登（Joss Whedon）、菲利普·格拉斯（Philip Glass）等许多人的访谈——当然，还有我们在网站www.thisamericanlife.org上的所有旧节目，都是免费的。

00:56:38.490 --> 00:56:52.500
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International. WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia. He's got this new way that he delivers our staff evaluations to us. He likes to print them out, roll them up--
